WEBVTT

00:04:56.199 --> 00:05:01.730
but it also can be
really downright scary.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:07.079
So when we look at why it is
that Pixar is able to do what it does,

00:05:07.079 --> 00:05:11.839
we have to ask ourselves,
what's going on here?

00:05:11.839 --> 00:05:14.800
For sure, history
and certainly Hollywood,

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.930
is full of star-studded teams
that have failed.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.790
Most of those failures are attributed

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:24.879
to too many stars or too many
cooks, if you will, in the kitchen.

00:05:24.879 --> 00:05:28.519
So why is it that Pixar,
with all of its cooks,

00:05:28.519 --> 00:05:33.360
is able to be so successful
time and time again?